{"version":1,"content":"<p>《愛‧回家之三代同糖》的主演吳若希自從在劇中「被流放」去吳旺達後，劇組先後安排不少藝人加入救亡，除了羅毓儀﹑穎喬及甄敏芳外，還有《愛‧回家之開心速遞》班底包括樊亦敏﹑歐瑞偉及沈可欣，有傳受歡迎的「龔水CP」呂慧儀和張景淳亦將回歸劇組。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:58.900582+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:10:03.621882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:58:42.527540+00:00","content_hash":"19e5b2b900b8caec74e4a450e3c41de561f82f2050e4da24440692e812d7ca4c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}